SUMMARY:Bill Blumenreich Presents Payne Lindsey
LOCATION:Arts at the Armory\, 191 Highland Ave\, Somerville\, MA 02143
DESCRIPTION:Payne Lindsey is a filmmaker and the creator and host of Up and
  Vanished\, the investigative podcast with more than 600 million downloads
 . His debut season brought national attention to the disappearance of Tara
  Grinstead\, with two arrests made as the series unfolded. A co-founder of
  Tenderfoot TV\, Lindsey is also known for Radio Rental\, Atlanta Monster\
 , and High Strange. Originally from Atlanta\, he now calls Boston home.\nh
 ttps://artsatthearmory.org/events/bill-blumenreich-presents-payne-lindsey/
 \nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/
